{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a98db613198b4611","name":"Logic Upgrade: Skill Swap","source":{"id":"source:reference-a98db613198b4611","title":"Logic Upgrade: Skill Swap","revision":21065,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:05:55Z","sha256":"355564ebe733f76589d2af47780990a81b539f1be6a66bceec77eb2bb553695f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21065","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Logic%20Upgrade%3A%20Skill%20Swap&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a98db613198b4611","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are able to quickly swap one programmed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," for another. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Basic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Basic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:14597e432df54ad5"}," can use this trick to enable it to attempt ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," in which it is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Basic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Basic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:14597e432df54ad5"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Select a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in (other than ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},"). As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you can swap this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," for one you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in. You do not gain any benefit from the original ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," while it is swapped out. You are not considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the swapped-in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},", and therefore you cannot use any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"},"-only options or add a bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},". You still add one-half your level and your associated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability"}," bonus, as usual.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you become ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," selected for this feat, you can select another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to replace it. You can take this feat more than once, each time selecting a different ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to swap.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
